on quality, whereas B lacks. Also crew cooperation: C creates positive atmosphere, puts concern for others above everything, which is strong for crew cooperation, despite communication difficulty. So we can argue C is better.\n\nThus we will state vote for Candidate C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: argue that C's decision quality and crew cooperation outweigh B's reliability and stress resilience, and that the lack of concrete decision examples for B is a bigger gap. Also note that C's communication difficulty is a concern but can be mitigated, and his egocentric may be less severe than B's nasty remarks. Provide explicit facts: \"can make correct decisions quickly\", \"keeps calm in crisis\", \"creates a positive atmosphere with his crew\", \"puts concern for others above everything\". Also mention concerns: \"difficulty communicating ideas\", \"egocentric\", \"not very willing to further his education\". Conclude that C is the best overall.\n\nNow METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
